Pseudocrossidium carinatum {{small|Zander, 1993}}
Pseudocrossidium chilense {{small|R.S.Williams, 1915}}
Pseudocrossidium crinitum {{small|Zander, 1993}}
Pseudocrossidium elatum {{small|Delgadillo M., 1975}}
